     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Counters",
     "texto": [
      "In Japanese, the name of an object usually goes with a counter. To ask for small quantities you can use the general series **ひとつ, ふたつ, みっつ…** (up to ten). For larger quantities a number + **こ** is used, for example **じゅういっこ** (eleven units)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
