     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where the quantity goes",
     "texto": [
      "The quantity usually goes after the object and its particle, before the verb: **コーヒー を ふたつ ください** (please give me two coffees). To ask «how many?», say **いくつ**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
